>     When I fight with two weapons, do my weapon skills get trained or just
> my twoweapon skill?

When you use #twoweapon fighting, you only train the twoweapon skill.
However, both twoweapon and individual weapon skill affect the result of
the attack.

>     How does one identify wands by scribing with them?

For most wands, you get some message when you Engrave with the wand.
Any individual wand type always gives the same message, so you can deduce
the type of the wand from the message.
But some of those messages can only been seen if there is already
something engraved to the same square, so FIRST engrave with your finger
and THEN with the wand.
Notice that there are some wands that don't give any message, and one of
the messages is common for three different wands and another one is common
for two other wands. And empty wands never give any message.
If you want spoilers for connecting the messages to the wands, you can
find a list at http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/ or
http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/ .

